WEBVTT

00:05:27.315 --> 00:05:30.032
No matter what I do,
I ask myself three questions:

00:05:30.056 --> 00:05:31.333
What do I want?

00:05:31.357 --> 00:05:33.025
Why do I want it?

00:05:33.049 --> 00:05:34.357
And how do I get it?

00:05:35.048 --> 00:05:37.570
And in this case, I know what I want.

00:05:37.594 --> 00:05:39.363
I want change.

00:05:39.387 --> 00:05:40.699
That is what I want.

00:05:40.723 --> 00:05:42.265
But the question is:

00:05:43.109 --> 00:05:45.042
What change do I want to see?

00:05:45.656 --> 00:05:48.325
And I know that the questions
I have to ask myself are:

00:05:48.349 --> 00:05:51.307
One, am I honest about the scope
of my ambition?

00:05:51.744 --> 00:05:55.212
Because it's easy to figure out
that once you didn't get what you wanted,

00:05:55.236 --> 00:05:58.001
then maybe you should
have set your sights a little lower,

00:05:58.025 --> 00:06:00.973
but I'm here to tell you
to be aggressive about your ambition.